  "description": "Fast, free, dependency-free PDF generation for .NET — from C# or from the HTML templates you already have. Fluent layout with automatic pagination and tables; HTML and CSS templates with flexbox, grid and style sheets, laid out within a point of what a browser prints; PDF/A archiving and PDF/UA accessible output; fillable forms; digital signatures; AES-256 encryption; QR codes and barcodes; SVG; images; right-to-left, Indic and colour-emoji text. No browser, no native libraries, no third-party packages. Trimming and Native AOT compatible. MIT licensed, commercial use included.",
